  m_text: '<size=22><color=#C9C4D6>CMM310 GAME DESIGN AND DEVELOPMENT  -  2026</color></size>



    <color=#FFB861>MECHANICS</color>

    Class Unity package - Condition-Action scripts

    HitAndShowHide   HitAndPlayAnimation   HitAndClone

    HitAndDestroy   HitAndSetTransform   HitAndLoadScene

    BallController   CameraFollow   LookAtTarget   ScrollingUVs   Fly


    <color=#FFB861>ART</color>

    Props modelled in Blender (procedural Python)

    Stone, lava and wood textures from the class packages

    Lanterns and candles from Session 2


    <color=#FFB861>SOUND</color>

    All sound effects and music synthesised in code


    <color=#FFB861>MADE WITH</color>

    Unity 6   Universal Render Pipeline   Blender 5




    <size=40><color=#FFB861>THANK YOU FOR PLAYING</color></size>'
